const PALETTES=[["#ff4f78","#5b2447","#ffd84d"],["#a56cff","#342465","#64f0d2"],["#ff9e42","#63302c","#fff06a"],["#4ce081","#145948","#ff63c2"],["#4bb7ff","#243764","#ffd34e"],["#eee8d9","#4a475e","#ff4f78"]];
function enhance(text,profile){const n=text.replace(/\s+/g,""),concepts=[...profile.concepts];if(/(平时|平常).{0,8}(不干|不做|偷懒).{0,16}(领导|老板).{0,8}(积极|勤快|表现)|领导.{0,8}(来|在|面前).{0,8}(积极|勤快|表现)/.test(n))concepts.unshift("performative","hypocrisy");if(/边缘化|排除在外|没找我|没叫我/.test(n))concepts.unshift("exclusion");if(/怀疑自己|是不是我|地位|被比下/.test(n))concepts.push("insecurity","comparison","rumination");profile.concepts=unique(concepts).filter(x=>DNA[x]).slice(0,4);return profile}
function makeBlueprint(concepts,random){const parts=unique(concepts.flatMap(x=>DNA[x]?.parts||[])),shapePool=["tower","cluster","spiral","frame","split","crescent","tangle","arch","stack","orbit","coil","totem"];return{coreShape:choose(shapePool,random),coreCount:range(1,4,random),width:+(.65+random()*.8).toFixed(2),height:+(.64+random()*.88).toFixed(2),symmetry:choose(["balanced","offset","lopsided","stacked","radial"],random),facePlacement:choose(["center","high","low","split","side","floating"],random),headCount:random()>.8?range(2,4,random):1,limbs:choose([0,2,4,6,8],random),locomotion:choose(["feet","wheels","hover","tendrils","hops","none"],random),material:choose(["metal","paper","neon","shadow","organic","glitch","glass","cloth"],random),anchorParts:shuffle(parts,random).slice(0,range(3,6,random)),scale:+(.78+random()*.42).toFixed(2),motion:choose(["jitter","swagger","hover","stomp","wave","flicker","pulse"],random)}}
function rarity(profile,random){const score=random()+profile.intensity*.2+profile.concepts.length*.06;return score>1.08?"BOSS":score>.9?"RARE":score>.62?"UNCOMMON":"COMMON"}
export function createLocalEncounter(text,mode="emotion",options={}){const seed=options.seed??hash(`${text}|${Date.now()}|${Math.random()}`),random=rng(seed),profile=enhance(text,understand(text,mode)),primary=DNA[profile.concepts[0]]||DNA.irritation,secondary=DNA[profile.concepts[1]],rare=options.rarity||rarity(profile,random),blueprint=makeBlueprint(profile.concepts,random),palette=choose(PALETTES,random),mutations=options.mutations||createMutations(seed,options.recent||[]),daily=options.includeDaily?todaysChaos(options.date):null;if(daily&&random()>.55)mutations.push(daily);const mutation=mergedMutation(mutations),armorPool=unique(profile.concepts.flatMap(x=>DNA[x]?.armor||[])),armorCount=Math.min(3,Math.max(1,range(1,2,random)+(mutation.armor.extra||0))),armor=shuffle(armorPool,random).slice(0,armorCount).map((label,i)=>({id:`armor-${i}-${hash(label).toString(36)}`,label,trait:blueprint.anchorParts[i%blueprint.anchorParts.length],state:"intact",durability:2+i})),name=`${choose(primary.front,random)}${choose(secondary?.core||primary.core,random)}`,maxHp=rare==="BOSS"?range(285,350,random):rare==="RARE"?range(205,245,random):rare==="UNCOMMON"?range(175,215,random):range(145,185,random),combat=unique([...shuffle(primary.combat,random).slice(0,2),...(secondary?shuffle(secondary.combat,random).slice(0,1):[])]),arena=createArenaDNA(profile.concepts,seed,mutations,choose(primary.arenas,random)),story=createStoryDNA(profile,rare,seed),visual={blueprint,primaryColor:palette[0],secondaryColor:palette[1],accentColor:palette[2],eyes:blueprint.anchorParts.includes("manyEyes")?range(5,10,random):blueprint.headCount*choose([1,2],random),mouth:blueprint.anchorParts.includes("crookedMouth")?"crooked":blueprint.anchorParts.includes("hugeMouth")?"huge":choose(["grin","frown","square"],random),arms:blueprint.limbs,legs:blueprint.locomotion==="feet"?choose([2,4,6],random):0,horns:random()>.67,texture:blueprint.material};const dialogue={intro:[`${profile.target}把“${profile.keyPhrase}”留在了这里。`,choose(primary.defiant,random)],taunt:shuffle(primary.defiant,random),defiant:shuffle(primary.defiant,random),cracked:shuffle(primary.cracked,random),breakdown:shuffle(primary.breakdown,random),ko:["……这次，轮不到我说了。","我撑不住这个样子了。"],grunts:primary.grunts,nemesis:["又是你。","这一次，我换了副壳。"],special:["场子也开始撑不住了。","你居然找到了那个机关。"]};return{version:4,id:uid("enc"),seed,origin:"local",createdAt:Date.now(),semanticDNA:{...profile,tokens:semanticTokens(text),label:primary.label},monsterDNA:{id:uid("monster"),name,rarity:rare,maxHp,represents:profile.concepts.map(x=>DNA[x]?.label).filter(Boolean).join("，"),visual,personality:`${profile.coreEmotion} · ${primary.label}`,combatPersonality:combat},symbolicArmorDNA:armor,arenaDNA:arena,combatDNA:{behaviors:combat,powerFantasy:true,releaseTarget:100},storyDNA:story,dialogueDNA:dialogue,mutationDNA:mutations,novelty:{silhouette:`${blueprint.coreShape}:${blueprint.coreCount}:${blueprint.symmetry}:${blueprint.limbs}:${blueprint.locomotion}`,arena:`${arena.theme}:${arena.layout}`,colors:palette.join("-"),armor:armor.map(x=>x.label).join("+"),combat:combat.join("+"),dialogueStyle:profile.concepts[0],mutation:mutationSignature(mutations),story:story.pattern},privacy:{rawPersisted:false}}}
export function localConceptLabel(id){return DNA[id]?.label||id}
